    {
      "text": "Watch a video about Audit Logs."
    },
    {
      "text": "Zscaler records the login name and IP address of every admin who logs in to the Zscaler Admin Console and changes policies or configuration settings. Audit logs display an admin's login and logout record (i.e., timestamps, actions, IP, etc.) and any configuration changes they completed. Audit logs are stored for up to 6 months."
    },
    {
      "text": "To view and filter admin audit log records, from the navigation menu, go to Data Explorer > Audit Logs > Mobile Administration.",
      "strong": [
        [
          76,
          89
        ],
        [
          92,
          102
        ],
        [
          105,
          126
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "For each admin audit record, the following information is displayed:"
    },
    {
